     A          R CHWHO
     A          H                           HLPARA(*RCD)
     A                                      HLPRCD(HCHWHO)
     A            WHDR          78A  O  1  2DSPATR(HI)
     A            WMSG          74A  O 21  3DSPATR(HI)
     A            WFK           78A  O 23  2COLOR(BLU)
     A                                  4  3'Chat with'
     A            WWHO          10A  B  4 24DSPATR(UL)
     A                                  4 37'A user ID, or EVERYONE.  F4 shows -
     A                                      a list'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HCHATSCR
     A                                  1  2'Help - Live chat'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'The screen shows the latest fourte-
     A                                      en lines of the conversation and'
     A                                  4  3'refreshes by itself every two seco-
     A                                      nds, so you see replies as they arr-
     A                                      ive.'
     A                                  6  3'Type what you want to say and pres-
     A                                      s Enter to send it.'
     A                                  7  3'F6 switches to a different person -
     A                                      or to the EVERYONE room.'
     A                                  8  3'F5 refreshes at once.  F3 leaves t-
     A                                      he chat.'
     A                                 10  3'The first time you write to someon-
     A                                      e in a session they get a system'
     A                                 11  3'message telling them you are waiti-
     A                                      ng, in case they are not in the cha-
     A                                      t.'
     A                                 13  3'If the screen does not refresh by -
     A                                      itself on your display, press Enter'
     A                                 14  3'or F5 to see new lines.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HCHWHO
     A                                  1  2'Help - Live chat - who with'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Type the user ID of the person to -
     A                                      chat with and press Enter.'
     A                                  4  3'F4 opens a list of enrolled users -
     A                                      to pick from.'
     A                                  6  3'Type EVERYONE to join the office c-
     A                                      hat room, which all users share.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
